# KAYAK: Compare flights, hotels, rental cars, and packages from hundreds of travel sites.

> KAYAK is a free travel metasearch engine. It searches hundreds of travel sites at once so travelers can compare and find the lowest available prices on flights, hotels, rental cars, and packages, with extensive filters to narrow results fast.
> KAYAK consistently deliver low prices and offer an extensive filtering system to cover niched and specific needs

